The IA-64 startup code (crt0-efi-ia64.S, reloc_ia64.S), linker script
(elf_ia64_efi.lds) and headers (inc/) of GNU-EFI,
https://github.com/ncroxon/gnu-efi, commit
f56c54402de23349bd658dc91eb508d7732a9970, unchanged. LICENSE.sources maps
GNU-EFI's directories to their licenses; the texts are in licenses/.
